type: software
title: "The Epistemic Governor: Supplementary Figure Scripts and Calibration Data"
abstract: "Figure generation scripts (Figures 1-5) and Fidelity Index calibration matrix for the manuscript 'The Epistemic Governor: Reconceiving Professional Identity and Methodological Accountability in AI-Assisted Scholarship.' Includes all 15 individual Phi scores across three calibration categories (Direct Extraction, Human Paraphrase, Stochastic Divergence) and the Reference Implementation symmetric chunking comparison. Verification threshold tau = .70. PCR architecture operationalizes all-mpnet-base-v2 sentence embeddings (Reimers & Gurevych 2019, 768-D) with cosine similarity scoring."
